disaster|catastrophic-event|NOUN|Event causing severe harm|An event that causes great damage, suffering, or loss.|thảm họa, tai họa gây tổn hại lớn|The landslide was a disaster for the farms below the hill.|Vụ sạt lở đất là một thảm họa đối với các trang trại dưới chân đồi.|Countable; this Sense concerns a seriously harmful event.|disaster
person|individual-human|NOUN|Individual human being|One human being considered as an individual.|một người|Only one person remained in the waiting room.|Chỉ còn một người trong phòng chờ.|Countable; the ordinary plural is people, while persons occurs in some formal uses.|person
defense|protective-action|NOUN|Action to protect|Actions or measures taken to protect someone or something against danger or attack.|sự phòng vệ, sự phòng thủ|The wall provided a defense against attacks from the valley.|Bức tường tạo sự phòng thủ trước các cuộc tấn công từ thung lũng.|American spelling defense; British spelling defence. Countability depends on whether a measure or activity is meant.|defense
spider|eight-legged-arachnid|NOUN|Eight-legged arachnid|A small animal with eight legs, belonging to the arachnid group.|con nhện|A spider hid beneath the rim of the flowerpot.|Một con nhện ẩn dưới mép chậu hoa.|Countable; spiders are arachnids, not insects.|spider
bottle|narrow-neck-container|NOUN|Container with a narrow neck|A container with a relatively narrow neck, commonly used to hold liquids.|chai|She rinsed the empty bottle before filling it with juice.|Cô ấy tráng chiếc chai rỗng trước khi đổ đầy nước ép vào đó.|Countable; a bottle of liquid can also identify the amount held in it.|bottle
equator|earth-midline|NOUN|Line midway between the poles|The imaginary line around Earth midway between its north and south poles.|đường xích đạo|The globe has a red line marking the equator.|Quả địa cầu có một đường màu đỏ đánh dấu đường xích đạo.|Normally the equator; separates the Northern and Southern Hemispheres.|equator
electric|electricity-powered|ADJECTIVE|Powered by electricity|Using electricity as its source of power.|chạy bằng điện|An electric pump moved water into the storage tank.|Một máy bơm điện đưa nước vào bồn chứa.|Used before nouns naming powered devices; this Sense does not mean exciting.|electric
fourteen|number-14|NUMBER|Number fourteen|The number that follows thirteen and precedes fifteen.|mười bốn|The club ordered fourteen identical notebooks.|Câu lạc bộ đặt mua mười bốn cuốn vở giống nhau.|Cardinal number; NUMBER remains a source taxonomy proposal awaiting canonical review.|fourteen
knight|medieval-warrior|NOUN|Medieval mounted warrior|A high-status warrior in medieval society, commonly serving a ruler.|hiệp sĩ, chiến binh có địa vị thời trung cổ|The knight rode through the castle gate at dawn.|Người hiệp sĩ cưỡi ngựa qua cổng lâu đài lúc bình minh.|Countable; this historical Sense does not cover the chess piece or modern honour.|knight
celebrate|mark-special-event|VERB|Mark a special event|To show that an event or occasion is special, often through enjoyable activities.|ăn mừng, kỷ niệm|They celebrated the opening of the bridge with music.|Họ ăn mừng việc khánh thành cây cầu bằng âm nhạc.|Transitive with an occasion, or intransitive without an object.|celebrate
among|within-group|PREPOSITION|Within a group or collection|In the middle of, surrounded by, or included within a group of things or people.|giữa, trong số một nhóm|She spotted her blue umbrella among the black ones.|Cô ấy nhận ra chiếc ô xanh lam của mình giữa những chiếc ô đen.|Used with a plural group or collection; the items need not be physically close.|among
statement|announced-message|NOUN|Expressed announcement|Something said or written to announce information or express a position.|lời tuyên bố, thông báo được nói hoặc viết|The council issued a statement about the road closure.|Hội đồng đưa ra một thông báo về việc đóng đường.|Countable; make, issue, or release a statement about something.|statement
refund|returned-payment|NOUN|Returned payment|Money paid back after a purchase or payment is cancelled or reversed.|khoản tiền hoàn lại|The shop offered a full refund for the damaged lamp.|Cửa hàng đề nghị hoàn lại toàn bộ tiền cho chiếc đèn bị hỏng.|Countable; get or request a refund. This proposal covers the noun.|refund
particular|specific-one|ADJECTIVE|Specific rather than general|Identifying one specific person or thing rather than others.|cụ thể, xác định riêng|Do you need a particular size of envelope?|Bạn có cần một cỡ phong bì cụ thể không?|Usually before a noun in this Sense; identifies a specific member or choice.|particular
particular|special-degree|ADJECTIVE|Special in degree|Greater or more marked than usual in a stated respect.|đặc biệt về mức độ|The curator took particular care when moving the old painting.|Người phụ trách bảo tàng đặc biệt cẩn thận khi di chuyển bức tranh cũ.|Often before abstract nouns such as care or interest; no particular means no special degree.|particular
money|payment-funds|NOUN|Funds used for payment|Coins, notes, or funds accepted for paying for goods and services.|tiền|They set aside money each month to repair the roof.|Họ dành riêng tiền mỗi tháng để sửa mái nhà.|Normally uncountable; an amount of money, not a money in ordinary use.|money
antibiotic|bacteria-medicine|NOUN|Medicine against bacteria|A medicine that kills bacteria or limits their growth.|thuốc kháng sinh|The label identifies the medicine as an antibiotic.|Nhãn xác định thuốc đó là một loại thuốc kháng sinh.|Countable; the term concerns bacteria and does not imply treatment for viral infections.|antibiotic
advertise|public-promotion|VERB|Promote publicly|To bring a product, service, or event to public attention in order to attract interest.|quảng cáo, quảng bá|The theatre advertised its new play on posters near the station.|Nhà hát quảng cáo vở kịch mới của mình trên những áp phích gần nhà ga.|Transitive with what is promoted; intransitive when the object is understood.|advertise
elephant|large-trunk-mammal|NOUN|Large mammal with a trunk|A very large land mammal with a long flexible trunk.|con voi|The elephant sprayed water over its back.|Con voi phun nước lên lưng của nó.|Countable; the trunk is characteristic, while tusks vary among individuals.|elephant
criteria|judging-standards|NOUN|Standards for judging|Standards used to judge something or make a decision.|các tiêu chí đánh giá hoặc quyết định|The committee published its criteria for choosing a winner.|Ủy ban công bố các tiêu chí của mình để chọn người thắng cuộc.|Criteria is plural; criterion is singular. Keep plural agreement in ordinary use.|criteria
journalist|news-reporter|NOUN|Person reporting news|Someone whose work involves gathering and presenting news to the public.|nhà báo|The journalist interviewed residents after the power cut.|Nhà báo phỏng vấn cư dân sau sự cố mất điện.|Countable; reporting may be written, spoken, or broadcast.|journalist
